sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Пользователь
    participant P as React UI
    participant C as BookingController
    participant M as BookingService
    participant F as BookingRepository
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    U->>P: Отмена бронирования
    P->>C: DELETE /api/bookings/{id}
    C->>M: cancel(id, username)
    M->>F: findWithRelationsById(id)
    F->>DB: SELECT booking + user + room
    DB-->>F: Booking
    F-->>M: Booking
    M->>M: проверка владельца
    M->>DB: UPDATE status=CANCELLED
    M-->>C: success
    C-->>P: 204 No Content
    P-->>U: Бронь отменена
